# Data Files
data/raw/usgs/*.pdf
data/raw/aqtesolv/*.json
data/raw/aqtesolv/*.html
data/processed/
# data/vectordb/ is deliberately COMMITTED: the Docker image copies it, so an
# ignored store would boot an app with an empty knowledge base. It is 38 MB and
# read-only at runtime. Only the built index ships; the source PDFs under
# "knowledge source/" are not needed to run the app.
data/vectordb_dev/

*.db
*.sqlite

